<title>UK: LLOYDS TSB RAISES BASE RATES TO 7.0 PCT.</title>
<headline>LLOYDS TSB RAISES BASE RATES TO 7.0 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank Lloyds TSB Group Plc said on Thursday it raised its base lending rates to 7.00 percent from 6.75 percent, effective at the close of business today.</p>
<p>Earlier, the Bank of England raised UK base rates to 7.00 percent from 6.75 percent. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
